      "message": "root is needed for --i2c-interface\u003dlinux.  I think our options are:\n\n[A] Leave sudo in place here (abandon this CL).\n[B] Delete sudo now, require that users run flash_ec as root when necessary.  (Not sure if this behavior change is acceptable to human users or lab automation.)\n[C] Delete sudo now, then in https://crrev.com/c/1301154 re-apply it conditionally based on --i2c-interface mode.\n\nIf root is needed with Servo v2, then my preference is [A] since soon all flash_ec invocations of iteflash will use either --i2c-interface\u003dftdi or --i2c-interface\u003dlinux.\n\nIf root is *not* needed with Servo v2, then my preference is [C].\n\nLet me know Servo v2 testing results.",
